:: Home Console Rhythm
<<set $outside to 0>>
<<if $location isnot "home" and $location isnot "alex_cottage">><<set $location to "home">><</if>>
<<effects>>
<<furnitureicon "controller">>You start the rhythm game. A line sweeps up and down the screen, each note is hit as the line crosses it.
<br><br>
<<nobr>><div id="rhythm" class="rhythm no-numberify"></div><</nobr>>
<<run setup.rhythmUI.open()>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Back to the console|Home Console]]>><<run setup.rhythmUI.leave()>><</link>>
<br>
